  "title": "[RPG Maker MZ] Plugin Compatibility Status",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "【RPGツクールMZ】プラグイン対応状況",
      "sourceHash": "838576bd7422bad2c5656b8b59cefe06ef264830343db2820863486ee0f9a2b2",
      "translation": "[RPG Maker MZ] Plugin Compatibility Status",
      "contextHash": "838576bd7422bad2c5656b8b59cefe06ef264830343db2820863486ee0f9a2b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "未対応のものも順次、対応していく予定です。",
      "sourceHash": "68116e342140328d30597045f3bfc947cb7625fb0f9a17a865d007d134027c56",
      "translation": "I plan to make the unsupported ones compatible as well, one by one.",
      "contextHash": "68116e342140328d30597045f3bfc947cb7625fb0f9a17a865d007d134027c56"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "対応済",
      "sourceHash": "2619bb45772c6c3230c2604733ea1a365b454bc153414c4bb4b8276154eb2653",
      "translation": "Supported",
      "contextHash": "2619bb45772c6c3230c2604733ea1a365b454bc153414c4bb4b8276154eb2653"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "対応したもの。あるいはMVからそのまま使えるプラグインです。",
      "sourceHash": "d7b170c8a5b5ce46e0a02a768484e9cd051cbee685b7369c457bef26e207a43e",
      "translation": "These are plugins that have been made compatible or can be used as-is from MV.",
      "contextHash": "d7b170c8a5b5ce46e0a02a768484e9cd051cbee685b7369c457bef26e207a43e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ただし、現段階ではまだまだ確認不足です。動作が怪しいようならご連絡ください。",
      "sourceHash": "7f69c59658ea9da98e8a177a0e94156db66a5cb1c31669ec70f74adbdf4ae765",
      "translation": "However, I still have a lot left to verify at this stage. Please contact me if anything seems to be malfunctioning.",
      "contextHash": "7f69c59658ea9da98e8a177a0e94156db66a5cb1c31669ec70f74adbdf4ae765"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "新規",
      "sourceHash": "fd6b6462657afe1c4fbc3529f131a8061be51bf11da5b00d79031346d9c78f3a",
      "translation": "New",
      "contextHash": "fd6b6462657afe1c4fbc3529f131a8061be51bf11da5b00d79031346d9c78f3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "新規で作成したプラグインです。",
      "sourceHash": "e488ca5ac82c160653d92283d224ec57d7ae43bd6853f09d4a6a8effb3a9430f",
      "translation": "These are newly created plugins.",
      "contextHash": "e488ca5ac82c160653d92283d224ec57d7ae43bd6853f09d4a6a8effb3a9430f"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "line-001",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "RPGツクールMZの発売に伴い、[[LINK_1]]MV用プラグイン[[/LINK_1]]をMZ向けに対応していく予定です。現在の対応状況をこのページへまとめていきます。",
      "sourceHash": "478b84ae7863ea9d2c932ae6a23f37744d4638c5dc99491de08e1044fcc93089",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "RPGツクールMZの発売に伴い、",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "MV用プラグイン",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "をMZ向けに対応していく予定です。現在の対応状況をこのページへまとめていきます。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "With the release of RPG Maker MZ, I plan to adapt the [[LINK_1]]MV plugins[[/LINK_1]] for MZ. I will compile the current compatibility status on this page.",
      "contextHash": "478b84ae7863ea9d2c932ae6a23f37744d4638c5dc99491de08e1044fcc93089"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-002",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "→全プラグインの移植が完了しました！ このページは今後更新されませんので、以後は[[LINK_1]]こちらの一覧[[/LINK_1]]をご覧ください！",
      "sourceHash": "dda74c9c2bf0f89aaae3e58ffc948eb0ac28c37ffe280ad60619adc6738cc1ea",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "→全プラグインの移植が完了しました！ このページは今後更新されませんので、以後は",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "こちらの一覧",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "をご覧ください！",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "→The porting of all plugins is complete! This page will no longer be updated, so please refer to [[LINK_1]]this list[[/LINK_1]] from now on!",
      "contextHash": "dda74c9c2bf0f89aaae3e58ffc948eb0ac28c37ffe280ad60619adc6738cc1ea"
    },
